OL,3,ARussia accuses Ukraine of attacking oil
OL,4,Arefinery after Zelensky says strikes to
OL,5,Aresume
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia has accused Ukraine of attacking
OL,8,Fan oil refinery after Volodymyr
OL,9,FZelensky said such strikes, halted at
OL,10,Fthe request of the US, would resume.
OL,12,FUkraine's president said he had
OL,13,Frestricted attacks for three days while
OL,14,FRussia had continued striking Ukrainian
OL,15,Fenergy infrastructure. "We're done," he
OL,16,Ftold the Financial Times.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
