OL,3,ARussia accuses Ukraine of attacking oil
OL,4,Arefinery after Zelensky says strikes to
OL,5,Aresume
OL,6,
OL,7,FZelensky also accused the US of
OL,8,Fwithdrawing intelligence-sharing on
OL,9,FRussian strikes to pressure Kyiv into
OL,10,Fending attacks altogether after it
OL,11,Fstruck a deal to import Russian diesel,
OL,12,Fand he said curbs on Starlink satellite
OL,13,Fservices used by Ukraine's military
OL,14,Fwere deliberate.
OL,16,FUkrainian defence sources told the BBC
OL,17,Fsome Starlink functionality had resumed
OL,18,Fas of Thursday morning.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
