OL,3,AAt least 33 pupils and teacher killed
OL,4,Aafter school roof collapses in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe roof of an upper-floor classroom
OL,7,Fhad collapsed, he said, causing
OL,8,Fceilings below to cave in and trap
OL,9,Fchildren beneath the debris.
